{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;When cherry blossoms fall upon the Red Cliffs' battlefield,<br>when katanas clash with Green Dragon Crescent Halberds...<br>Unleash an epoch-making clash across time and space!&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this fantastical realm blending auto-chess tactics and roguelike deck-building,<br>you\u2019ll shatter historical boundaries to command a legendary legion of Three Kingdoms heroes and Sengoku warlords.<br>Each run sparks a new deck evolution journey\u2014forge irreplicable synergy bonds on procedurally generated battlefields,<br>and conquer ever-shifting chessboards with your strategic brilliance!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Diverse Character Cards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect <strong>100+ uniquely styled cards</strong>, each with distinctive skills. Experiment with synergies to build unstoppable decks\u2014the more cards you gather, the more explosive combo strategies you\u2019ll unlock!<br><i>(More cards in development\u2014Coming Soon!)</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlock New Heroes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command <strong>8 playable heroes</strong>, each boasting game-changing mechanics and ultimate abilities.<br><i>(Additional heroes underway\u2014Stay Tuned!)</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic Card Market</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire cards by conquering brutal challenges or trading in the <strong>live-updating marketplace</strong>\u2014where buy/sell orders refresh every hour! Strengthen your deck to take on higher difficulties.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Brutal Challenges Await</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle through <strong>6 escalating difficulty tiers</strong> against unpredictable enemy formations. With a <strong>scaling power system</strong> that infinitely boosts both you and foes, every victory demands sharper tactics.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Cycle Reboot",